WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.177
This query reads the patient admission summary view.

00:00:03.177 --> 00:00:07.757
Consumers do not need to repeat the join or stay-duration expression.

00:00:07.757 --> 00:00:10.657
The view already defines that interface.

00:00:10.657 --> 00:00:13.062
Run it and identify the grain.

00:00:13.062 --> 00:00:19.426
One row represents one admission with selected patient attributes and a derived stay duration.
